<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT--Technology Solutions raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT--Technology Solutions raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co said its analyst Eric Upin raised its rating on shares of Technology Solutions Co to buy from long-term attractive based on strong market fundamentals for systems integration and software implementation services.</p>
<p>-- In a written statement, Upin also noted the company has a positive book to bill ratio of 1.26 to 1.00, meaning that for $1.00 worth of shipments it brings in $1.26 of orders.</p>
<p>-- Upin also raised earnings estimates on the company to $0.84 a share from $0.81 for fiscal 1997 and to $1.15 from $1.10 for fiscal 1998.</p>
</text>
